  "full_passage_spoken": "My favorite season is spring. The air is warm. I see a flower. I walk outside. I ride my bike. I feel full of hope. Spring is my favorite. I wait for it every year. Warm air and a flower mean spring is here. I go outside and ride my bike. Every year this season fills me with hope.",
